# Requirements of the `reboot[std-blob]` extra: what the blob library's
# `S3Bucket` speaks S3 with. Only an application that keeps blobs
# installs it, which spares every other application the AWS SDK and
# its service models. Every line must also be in `requirements.in`,
# which stays the complete list that the Bazel lock compiles; the
# wheel build strips these from the package's dependencies and ships
# them as the extra.
boto3==1.43.118 # Latest as of 2026/10/22.
